            "title": "Novo's GLP-1 fails Alzheimer's trial goals, Tegna stock falls",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks Monday's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Bitcoin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) is down about 30% from its peak, trading around $87,000.</p>\n<p>Shares of broadcast company Tegna (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TGNA\">TGNA</a>) are falling after President Trump said he was against the Federal Communications Commission (FCC) lifting its cap on local TV station ownership.</p>\n<p>Novo Nordisk (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVO\">NVO</a>) stock is under pressure after the company's GLP-1 failed its late-stage trial goals for treating Alzheimer's.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
